{
  "choices": [
    {
      "message": {
        "content": "{\n  \"chapter_id\": \"CH03\",\n  \"chapter_argument\": \"肠道微生物群通过免疫启动（DC/T 细胞互作）、代谢物信号（SCFAs、肌苷、色氨酸/胆汁酸受体通路）及屏障完整性/细菌易位三大路径调制实体瘤 ICI 疗效。临床前模型已确立明确的因果链条，但人类数据多为观察性关联，需严格区分物种差异与肿瘤类型特异性，避免将动物模型结论直接外推为临床事实。关键代谢物的人类肿瘤微环境浓度数据尚缺，现有证据主要依赖血浆相关性与小鼠模型。\",\n  \"units\": [\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"CH03_U01\",\n      \"focus\": \"阐明共生菌通过 PRR/NOD2 轴与分子模拟桥接先天与适应性免疫的机制，明确 DC 成熟与 T 细胞交叉反应在 ICI 疗效增强中的核心作用。\",\n      \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U01_P01\",\n          \"point\": \"DC 成熟是免疫启动的限速步骤，不同共生菌通过 PRRs/NOD2 轴差异化调控 DC 表型。\",\n          \"development\": \"比较双歧杆菌、阿克曼氏菌与肠球菌对 DC 表型（MHC-I/II、CD80/86、IL-12 分泌）的调控差异；引入 SagA 肽聚糖水解酶/NOD2 轴作为分子开关，说明特定菌株如何突破稳态触发 DC 活化。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0587\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供肌苷通过抑制 UBA6 增强肿瘤免疫原性的机制背景，辅助说明 DC 活化后的下游效应。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0613\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"综述特定菌株（如 A. muciniphila）与 DC 成熟及 ICI 疗效的临床关联证据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0114\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 Ruminococcaceae 通过 IRF8/NFATc1 通路激活 CD103+ DCs 的具体机制证据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0464\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"概述微生物群调节抗肿瘤免疫的多层次机制，包括先天到适应性免疫的广泛通路。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U01_P02\",\n          \"point\": \"分子模拟假说提供交叉反应性 T 细胞扩增的机制桥梁，补充传统 DC-T 细胞轴之外的非经典路径。\",\n          \"development\": \"阐述微生物抗原与肿瘤新抗原序列同源性如何诱导预存记忆 T 细胞克隆；结合肌苷通过 UBA6 抑制解除 MHC-I 类分子加工限制的非经典途径，说明微生物如何通过双重靶向增强内在免疫原性。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0582\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供肌苷直接靶向肿瘤细胞 UBA6 解除 MHC-I 加工限制的具体分子机制。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0606\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"综述微生物代谢物与免疫细胞互作的一般性原则，支持分子模拟的理论框架。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0085\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"解释异源记忆 T 细胞如何通过交叉反应识别新抗原，提供理论桥梁。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0190\",\n              \"role\": \"例证\",\n              \"use\": \"展示外膜囊泡 (OMVs) 携带微生物抗原诱导交叉反应性 T 细胞的具体实验证据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0388\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"阐述 SFB 诱导的 T_H17 细胞在 ICI 作用下转化为 T_H1-like 细胞的表型可塑性机制。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"提供“分子模拟”假说的理论框架及量化方法（TAS），连接菌群组成与治疗响应。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U01_P03\",\n          \"point\": \"临床前因果证据与人类观察性数据的证据等级差异警示直接外推风险。\",\n          \"development\": \"对比无菌鼠/人源化鼠定植实验的强因果效力与人类队列的观察性局限；强调物种间 DC 发育轨迹与 TLR 信号通路的差异，警示跨物种外推的局限性。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0490\",\n              \"role\": \"比较\",\n              \"use\": \"对比临床前模型与人类数据在免疫调节机制上的差异，指出外推挑战。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0613\",\n              \"role\": \"局限\",\n              \"use\": \"指出人类队列中微生物特征与 ICI 疗效关联的观察性性质及混杂因素。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0606\",\n              \"role\": \"比较\",\n              \"use\": \"强调物种间免疫系统差异，特别是 TLR 信号基线与 DC 发育轨迹的不同。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"CH03_U02\",\n      \"focus\": \"解析 SCFAs、肌苷、色氨酸/胆汁酸等代谢物通过受体介导的表观遗传与转录重编程调制 TME 的生化基础，明确浓度阈值与情境依赖性。\",\n      \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U02_P01\",\n          \"point\": \"SCFAs 的浓度依赖性与情境依赖性呈现双刃剑效应。\",\n          \"development\": \"详述丁酸/丙酸在生理黏膜浓度下促进 Treg 分化，而在肿瘤炎症微环境中通过 HDAC 抑制上调 MHC-I 并增强 CD8+ T 细胞杀伤力；引用定量浓度数据说明阈值效应与微环境 pH/氧分压的情境依赖性。强调人类 TME 内 SCFA 直接浓度数据缺失，现有证据基于粪便/血浆样本。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0092\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 SCFAs 与实体瘤 ICI 临床响应关联的观察性证据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0413\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"详述 SCFAs 的双刃剑效应（HDAC 抑制 vs Treg 分化）及其分子通路。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0075\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供微生物代谢物驱动免疫重编程的机制图谱，包括 HDAC 抑制具体路径。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"提供肌苷与 SCFAs 在肿瘤微环境中时空分布变化的背景，解释语境依赖性。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0606\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"综述代谢物信号通路的普遍机制，支持 SCFAs 的情境依赖性论述。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U02_P02\",\n          \"point\": \"肌苷通过 A2AR 与 UBA6 的双向靶向克服 ICI 耐药，但人类 TME 浓度数据缺失。\",\n          \"development\": \"阐述肌苷作为嘌呤代谢中间产物，既可通过腺苷 A2A 受体（A2AR）促进 Th1 分化，又直接进入肿瘤细胞抑制泛素激活酶 UBA6，解除对 MHC-I 类分子加工的限制，从而增强内在免疫原性。明确指出人类肿瘤微环境内肌苷绝对浓度数据尚未测定，现有证据依赖 CheckMate 025 血浆相关性（中位 OS 33 个月 vs. 22 个月）与小鼠模型验证。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0582\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供肌苷抑制 UBA6 增强肿瘤免疫原性的核心实验证据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"综述肌苷在复杂疾病中的多面角色，支持其在免疫调节中的机制描述。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供肌苷信号在结直肠癌中的时空重编程证据，支持其双向调节作用。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0606\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"提供微生物代谢物调制系统免疫的机制背景，支持肌苷通路论述。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0613\",\n              \"role\": \"例证\",\n              \"use\": \"引用 CheckMate 025 血浆相关性数据，说明肌苷水平与生存获益的关联。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U02_P03\",\n          \"point\": \"色氨酸-AhR 轴与胆汁酸核受体的双向免疫调节。\",\n          \"development\": \"对比促炎/抗炎分支：犬尿氨酸激活 AhR 促进 Treg/MDSC 积累导致耐药；而吲哚衍生物（IPA/IAA）激活 AhR 或核受体（FXR/TGR5）可逆转免疫抑制；胆汁酸（UDCA vs DCA/LCA）呈现剂量与受体依赖的双刃剑效应。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0413\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"详述代谢物效应的异质性和双向性，包括 AhR 通路的具体机制。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0606\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"综述色氨酸代谢与胆汁酸通路在免疫调节中的一般性原则。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0180\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供肠道微生物群 - 胆汁酸-FXR 互作的详细机制，支持核受体通路论述。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0476\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"展示代谢物效应的情境依赖性（如 TMAO 在不同癌种中的相反作用），支持双向调节观点。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"CH03_U03\",\n      \"focus\": \"论证肠道物理屏障完整性是决定微生物信号系统性“泄漏”的闸门，分析细菌易位重塑远端免疫景观或引发 irAEs 的双重后果。\",\n      \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U03_P01\",\n          \"point\": \"屏障完整性决定微生物信号的系统性\\\"泄漏\\\"阈值。\",\n          \"development\": \"分析紧密连接蛋白（ZO-1, Occludin）与杯状细胞黏液层在维持生态位中的作用；对比健康稳态与菌群失调（如抗生素暴露、高脂饮食）下的通透性变化及其对循环内毒素水平的直接影响。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0606\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"综述肠道屏障功能在微生物 - 免疫轴中的基础作用。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0454\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"分析饮食模式（如纤维、生酮）对屏障完整性和免疫治疗结果的潜在影响。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0073\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供肠道芯片模型中屏障完整性与 ICI 响应关联的体外证据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0153\",\n              \"role\": \"例证\",\n              \"use\": \"以 PEG 肠道准备为例，说明医疗干预对微生物组和屏障的瞬时扰动及其对 ICI 的潜在负面影响。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U03_P02\",\n          \"point\": \"易位细菌被次级淋巴器官捕获后触发远端抗肿瘤免疫或引发 irAEs。\",\n          \"development\": \"阐述易位细菌如何被引流淋巴结捕获并触发远端抗肿瘤免疫景观重塑；结合空间多组学与活体成像证据说明易位的时空动态，并指出同一易位事件可能同时驱动抗肿瘤效应与 irAEs 发生。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0166\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 ICB 诱导肠道细菌物理转移并增强肠外抗肿瘤免疫的具体机制证据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0557\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"阐述肿瘤来源 EVs 与肠道微生物互作，间接重塑 TME 免疫抑制状态的中间环节。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0574\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供菌群失调导致免疫耐药及 irAEs 风险的全面机制背景和生物标志物（如 sMAdCAM-1）。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0523\",\n              \"role\": \"比较\",\n              \"use\": \"对比放疗诱导微生物改变与直接微生物调控在免疫调节中的风险与归因差异。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U03_P03\",\n          \"point\": \"屏障修复策略与易位调控的临床转化潜力。\",\n          \"development\": \"探讨屏障修复剂、靶向益生菌清除易位病原体及空间控释递送系统的转化前景；强调需在恢复屏障稳态与保留有益信号\\\"泄漏\\\"之间取得平衡。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0523\",\n              \"role\": \"发展\",\n              \"use\": \"提出肠道靶向策略在放疗与免疫治疗交叉点的转化前景。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0574\",\n              \"role\": \"发展\",\n              \"use\": \"基于 ONCOBIOME 等倡议进展，提出微生物群落动态监测与干预的优先事项。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n              \"role\": \"例证\",\n              \"use\": \"以 ICI 相关结肠炎为例，说明特定菌群标志物（产丁酸菌缺失）与不良反应的因果关联，支持靶向干预必要性。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0335\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"提供新辅助免疫治疗后吻合口瘘与微生物群关联的理论框架，支持屏障修复策略。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"CH03_U04\",\n      \"focus\": \"整合三大调制路径的证据等级，严格界定临床前因果链与人类观察性数据的转化边界，明确未来研究优先事项。\",\n      \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U04_P01\",\n          \"point\": \"临床前因果链的强效力与人类观察性数据的异质性形成证据鸿沟。\",\n          \"development\": \"对比无菌鼠/人源化鼠定植实验的强因果效力与人类队列（如 P0613, P0490）的观察性局限；强调物种间 DC 发育轨迹、TLR 信号基线与肿瘤微环境理化参数的差异，警示直接外推风险。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0490\",\n              \"role\": \"比较\",\n              \"use\": \"对比临床前与临床证据在免疫调节机制上的效力差异。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0613\",\n              \"role\": \"局限\",\n              \"use\": \"指出人类临床证据多为观察性关联，因果推断需谨慎。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0606\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"综述治疗 implications 中的证据等级差异，支持转化边界论述。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n              \"role\": \"例证\",\n              \"use\": \"以 MIMic 试验为例，说明 FMT 在人类中的安全性与生存获益，但仍属早期试验。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U04_P02\",\n          \"point\": \"肿瘤类型特异性与测序方法学差异加剧结果不可比性。\",\n          \"development\": \"分析黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC、CRC 等癌种间菌群基线、ICI 响应阈值与代谢物阈值的显著差异；指出 16S rRNA 与宏基因组测序、样本采集与存储流程的不一致如何放大结果异质性。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0613\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"汇总不同肿瘤队列中微生物特征与 ICI 响应的异质性数据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0490\",\n              \"role\": \"比较\",\n              \"use\": \"分析不同癌种间菌群基线与代谢物阈值的差异。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0002\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供跨癌种微生物组功能分层预测 ICI 响应的宏观生态学视角。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0097\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"通过机器学习框架量化功能通路 vs 分类学特征在预测 NSCLC ICI 响应上的差异。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH03_U04_P03\",\n          \"point\": \"转化准备度评估：从概念验证到标准化 RCT 的必经之路。\",\n          \"development\": \"总结当前证据等级（临床前强因果 vs 人类中等/低确定性观察），提出 III 期 RCT、多中心标准化采样、配对血清/肿瘤组织代谢物定量及 AI 辅助多组学整合的优先事项；明确当前仅支持谨慎的抗生素管理与探索性 FMT，不支持常规益生菌推荐。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0613\",\n              \"role\": \"发展\",\n              \"use\": \"评估当前干预手段（FMT、饮食、抗生素）的临床效果与方法学局限性。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0490\",\n              \"role\": \"发展\",\n              \"use\": \"提出调节肠道微生物增强免疫治疗的机遇与挑战，支持转化路线图。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0534\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"提供微生物组调节与 ICI 结果的定性主题综合，界定讨论边界。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n              \"role\": \"例证\",\n              \"use\": \"以 MIMic 试验结果支持 FMT 探索性应用的可行性。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"role\": \"发展\",\n              \"use\": \"基于 FMT-LUMINate 试验数据，提出 FMT 诱导有害病原体清除的新机制框架及安全性风险。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to act as a **Chapter Editor** for a review article chapter (CH03).\nMy task is to organize the writing tasks for this chapter based on the provided input data.\nI need to:\n1.  **Allocate all selected sources** (`sources`) to paragraph tasks or table tasks.\n2.  **Organize sources with only case-level uses** into paragraphs or tables (though in this input, `case_level_uses` is empty for all units, so I focus on the `existing_paragraph_tasks` and `sources`).\n3.  **Define paragraph tasks**: `point`, `development`, and `source_uses` (role + use).\n4.  **Reference existing paragraph tasks**: I must use the `paragraph_id` from `existing_paragraph_tasks` in my output. I should not rewrite the `point`/`development` if I can reference the existing task, but the output schema requires me to fill `point` and `development` in the `paragraph_tasks` object. Wait, the instruction says: \"引用负责人原任务，不重写研究内容：用 `source_briefs` 引用 `existing_paragraph_tasks` 的 `paragraph_id`；`point`/`development` 可省略，程序会回填负责人原文。\"\n    *   *Correction*: Looking at the Output Contract JSON schema provided in the prompt:\n        ```json\n        \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n          {\n            \"paragraph_id\": \"...\",\n            \"point\": \"...\",\n            \"development\": \"...\",\n            \"source_uses\": [...]\n          }\n        ]\n        ```\n        But the instruction says: \"`point`/`development` 可省略，程序会回填负责人原文\". However, the JSON schema doesn't show `source_briefs` or a way to reference the ID *instead* of content.\n        Let's re-read carefully: \"每个段落任务写清：作者要表达的判断（`point`）、展开逻辑（`development`）、以及每篇来源在这段里做什么... 引用负责人原任务，不重写研究内容：用 `source_briefs` 引用 `existing_paragraph_tasks` 的 `paragraph_id`\".\n        Actually, looking at the provided Output Contract schema again:\n        ```json\n        {\n          \"chapter_id\": \"...\",\n          \"chapter_argument\": \"...\",\n          \"units\": [\n            {\n              \"unit_id\": \"...\",\n              \"focus\": \"...\",\n              \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"...\",\n                  \"point\": \"...\",\n                  \"development\": \"...\",\n                  \"source_uses\": [...]\n                }\n              ],\n              ...\n            }\n          ],\n          ...\n        }\n        ```\n        There is no `source_briefs` field in the *Output Contract* schema provided in the \"输出合同\" section.\n        However, the instruction text says: \"用 `source_briefs` 引用 `existing_paragraph_tasks` 的 `paragraph_id`\". This seems like a conflict between the instruction text and the JSON schema example.\n        Usually, in these tasks, I should follow the JSON schema for the final output. But the instruction explicitly says \"point/development 可省略，程序会回填负责人原文\". If I omit them, the JSON might be invalid if they are required fields.\n        Let's look at the instruction again: \"输出合同（只返回一个 JSON 对象）... `point`: \"这一段要让读者得到的判断\", `development`: \"展开逻辑...\"\".\n        Okay, I will follow the JSON schema structure. Since the instruction says I can omit `point`/`development` if I reference the ID, but the schema implies they are keys, I will try to include them but keep them aligned with the existing tasks to avoid rewriting content unnecessarily, OR I will follow the specific instruction \"引用负责人原任务... `point`/`development` 可省略\".\n        Wait, if I omit them in the JSON, it might break the schema validation if the consumer expects them.\n        Let's look at the \"Output Contract\" section again. It lists `point` and `development` as keys.\n        However, the instruction \"段落任务引用合同\" says: \"每个 paragraph_task 用 `source_briefs` 列出它来自哪些 `paragraph_id`... `point`/`development` 可以省略\".\n        This implies the JSON schema in the \"Output Contract\" section might be a template, but the specific instruction for *this* task (Chapter Editor) overrides it regarding `point`/`development`.\n        *Decision*: I will include `point` and `development` in the JSON because the \"Output Contract\" schema explicitly lists them as required keys for `paragraph_tasks`. I will copy them from the `existing_paragraph_tasks` provided in the input to ensure I don't rewrite the research content (adhering to \"不重写研究内容\"). This satisfies both the schema and the instruction to not rewrite.\n        *Wait, one more check*: The instruction says \"用 `source_briefs` 引用...\". The Output Contract schema does *not* have a `source_briefs` field in `paragraph_tasks`. It has `source_uses`.\n        This is a contradiction. The instruction text describes a field (`source_briefs`) that is not in the Output Contract JSON schema.\n        *Resolution*: I must follow the **Output Contract JSON Schema** for the final output structure. The instruction text might be describing an internal process or a different version. I will map the `existing_paragraph_tasks` to the `paragraph_tasks` in the output, keeping the `paragraph_id`, `point`, and `development` from the input (to avoid rewriting), and add the `source_uses` allocation.\n        *Wait, another constraint*: \"每个已有段落 id 都必须被至少一个任务引用\".\n        So I must iterate through all `existing_paragraph_tasks` in the input and ensure they appear in the output `paragraph_tasks`.\n        I also need to allocate all `sources` to `source_uses` within these paragraphs or tables.\n        If a source is not used, it goes to `unused_sources`.\n\n        *Plan*:\n        1.  Iterate through `units`.\n        2.  For each `unit`, iterate through `existing_paragraph_tasks`.\n        3.  Create a `paragraph_task` in output with the same `paragraph_id`, `point`, and `development` (copying from input to avoid rewriting).\n        4.  Assign `sources` to these paragraphs based on the `current_uses` in the `sources` list (which links `source_handle` to `paragraph_id`).\n        5.  Check if all `sources` are assigned.\n        6.  Check if all `existing_paragraph_tasks` are included.\n        7.  Construct `chapter_argument` based on `thesis` and `purpose`.\n        8.  Construct `focus` for each unit based on `substantive_point` or `title`/`synthesis`.\n\n        *Source Allocation*:\n        The input `sources` list has `current_uses` which already links `source_handle` to `unit_id` and `paragraph_id`.\n        Example: `P0002` -> `CH03_U04`, `CH03_U04_P02`.\n        I should use this mapping to populate `source_uses` in the corresponding paragraph task.\n        I need to define the `role` and `use` for each source in that paragraph.\n        The `material_purpose` in `sources` gives me a hint on what the source does. I need to condense this into `use`.\n        The `role` should be one of: `主论据`, `背景`, `例证`, `比较`, `局限`, `发展`.\n\n        *Unused Sources*:\n        I need to check if every `source_handle` in `sources` is assigned to a paragraph.\n        Let's list all handles from `sources`:\n        P0002, P0017, P0073, P0075, P0085, P0092, P0097, P0114, P0153, P0166, P0180, P0190, P0335, P0388, P0413, P0454, P0464, P0476, P0490, P0523, P0534, P0557, P0561, P0574, P0577, P0582, P0583, P0587, P0590, P0600, P0606, P0613.\n        Total 32 sources.\n        I need to make sure all 32 are in `source_uses` somewhere or in `unused_sources`.\n        The `current_uses` in `sources` already maps them to paragraphs. I will follow that mapping primarily, but I can adjust `role` and `use` text.\n        Wait, `P0587` has `material_depth`: \"\" and `material_purpose` is a JSON string `{\"auxiliary_material\": ...}`. It seems a bit malformed in the input but I should still allocate it if possible. It is linked to `CH03_U01_P01` in `current_uses`.\n        \n        *Refining `source_uses`*:\n        For each source in a paragraph, I need to write a specific `use` description. I can derive this from `material_purpose` but tailor it to the paragraph's `point`.\n        \n        *Tables*:\n        The input